id=op15_nethunter_wifi
name=OP15 Nethunter Wi-Fi Injection Drivers
version=v1.30.1
versionCode=45
author=XxxY
description=OP15 Nethunter Wi-Fi + camera toolkit: 33 Wi-Fi injection drivers (RTL 8812au/8821au/88x2bu, Atheros AR9271, MediaTek MT7601U/MT7921, Realtek rtw88 8822bu/8821cu/8723du, +Atheros AR9170/carl9170, MediaTek MT7612U/mt76x2u, Ralink RT2800USB) built from Ember a7ac01b (KMI 0xe976b219, loads on stock kernel; 8812au from the aircrack-ng tree, which survives monitor mode on 6.12, plus a WEXT fix so a redundant SIOCSIWMODE from mdk4/aircrack-ng no longer panics the kernel - monitor and capture verified on 2.4 and 5 GHz, RECEIVE-ONLY: any transmit on the external adapter panics the kernel - not just injection but a plain managed-mode scan too (probe requests), measured on OP15 6.12. Scan, deauth and PMKID therefore refuse rather than crash the phone; monitor mode and passive capture are unaffected and work on 2.4 and 5 GHz, instead of transmitting into an empty channel). Bundled iw+mdk4+tcpdump+hcxdumptool+hcxpcapngtool+kocrc+v4lgrab+camscan+ffmpeg+aircrack-ng + Atheros/MediaTek/Realtek firmware blobs (ath9k_htc/mt7601u/mt76-mt7961/rtw88) shipped at system/etc/firmware and magic-mounted to /etc/firmware - a firmware_class path inside the module directory never worked, because the kernel domain is not allowed to read anything under /data and the direct load returns -13 with no AVC logged. WebUI: tabbed (Home/Radio/Attack/Cam/Keys/Tools/Help) with multilingual (EN/FR/DE/ES/IT) user guide with glossy capsule bottom bar; auto-detect+load, monitor, scan, deauth, handshake+PMKID capture, USB (UVC) webcam snapshot/live/record over OTG, network CCTV/DVR discovery+RTSP viewer (built-in ffmpeg snapshot + player live + record to mp4, local or remote) + DVR-HDD playback URL builder (Hik/Dahua/ONVIF, brand autodetect + ONVIF discovery + default-credential audit + ARP-spoof login sniffer), saved-password reveal, and chroot-free on-device crack of captured handshakes with bundled aircrack-ng (wordlist from Kali chroot rockyou or your own path).
